---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Header from '../components/Header.astro'; import ServiceCard from '../components/ServiceCard.astro'; import ContactLink from '../components/ContactLink.astro'; import QuoteForm from '../components/QuoteForm.astro'; import {business} from '../data/business.js';
const services=business.services.filter(s=>s.enabled);const wa=business.whatsappNumber.replace(/\D/g,'').length>=8;
---
<BaseLayout><Header/><main id="top">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> PLUMBING & HOME SERVICES <span class="hero-location">{business.address}</span></div><h1>{business.headline}</h1><p class="hero-lead">{business.description}</p><div class="hero-actions"><ContactLink business={business} label="Call now"/><ContactLink business={business} kind="whatsapp" label="WhatsApp us" class="button button-outline-light"/><a class="hero-quote-link" href="#quote">Request a quote ↓</a></div><div class="hero-proof"><span>✓</span> Clear communication <b></b> Local service enquiries</div></div><div class="hero-media"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621905251918-48416bd8575a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=88" alt="Professional plumber checking pipework in a residential home" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-image-shade"></div><div class="hero-image-label">● Plumbing support, made straightforward</div><div class="floating-card"><span>⌁</span><small>NEED A HAND?<strong>Let's talk through it.</strong></small><a href="#quote">↗</a></div></div></div><div class="wrap hero-bottom"><span>RESIDENTIAL & COMMERCIAL ENQUIRIES</span><i></i><span>JOHANNESBURG · GAUTENG</span></div></section>
<div class="intro-strip"><div class="wrap"><strong>N<span>·</span></strong><p>{business.tagline}</p><small>DEPENDABLE PLUMBING<br/>STARTS WITH A GOOD CONVERSATION</small></div></div>
<section id="services" class="section-pad services"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow dark"><i></i> HOW WE CAN HELP</div><h2>Practical help for<br/><span>the things that flow.</span></h2></div><p>Every property is different. Choose a service to start a conversation about what you need.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map((service,index)=><ServiceCard service={service} index={index}/>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="emergency-band"><div class="wrap emergency-inner"><small>● {business.emergency.enabled?business.emergency.availability:'URGENT HELP? ASK ABOUT AVAILABILITY'}</small><div><h2>{business.emergency.enabled?'Plumbing emergency?':'Something gone wrong?'}</h2><p>{business.emergency.note}</p></div><div class="emergency-actions"><ContactLink business={business} label="Call for assistance" class="button button-light"/><ContactLink business={business} kind="whatsapp" label="Send a message" class="emergency-whatsapp"/></div></div></section>
<section id="about" class="section-pad about"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div class="about-visual"><img src={business.gallery[0].src} alt={business.gallery[0].alt} loading="lazy"/><span>01 / SERVICE APPROACH</span></div><div><div class="eyebrow dark"><i></i> A LITTLE ABOUT US</div><h2>Good service begins<br/>with <span>listening.</span></h2><p>{business.about}</p><ul>{business.trustIndicators.map(item=><li>✓ &nbsp;{item}</li>)}</ul><a class="inline-link" href="#quote">Tell us what you need ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section id="areas" class="section-pad areas"><div class="wrap areas-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> WHERE WE WORK</div><h2>Close to home.<br/><span>Ready to help.</span></h2><p>Ask about availability for your property. This sample coverage is editable and must be confirmed by the business.</p></div><div class="area-list">{business.serviceAreas.map((area,i)=><div><small>0{i+1}</small><strong>{area}</strong><span>↗</span></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section-pad steps"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow dark"><i></i> SIMPLE NEXT STEPS</div><h2>From first message<br/>to <span>fixed.</span></h2></div><p>A clear process makes it easier to get the right help, without the guesswork.</p></div><div class="steps-grid">{[['Get in touch','Call, message or send a quote request with the best way to reach you.'],['Describe the issue','Share what you have noticed and where the property is located.'],['Discuss the options','The business can assess the request and explain next steps or a quotation.'],['Arrange the service','Confirm a suitable time directly before work is scheduled.']].map(([title,desc],i)=><article><b>0{i+1}</b><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="gallery"><div class="gallery-photo"><img src={business.gallery[1].src} alt={business.gallery[1].alt} loading="lazy"/><div><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> CARE FOR YOUR PROPERTY</div><p>Reliable help,<br/><span>right where you need it.</span></p></div></div><div class="gallery-copy"><small>HOME · WORKPLACE · EVERYDAY</small><h2>Take care of<br/>what matters.</h2><p>Thoughtful repairs and maintenance can help keep your space working as it should.</p><a class="button button-accent" href="#quote">Talk to the team ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section-pad testimonials"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow dark"><i></i> SAMPLE CUSTOMER FEEDBACK</div><h2>Trust is built<br/><span>one job at a time.</span></h2></div><p>Examples demonstrate the layout only. Replace with approved genuine reviews or remove this section.</p></div><div class="review-grid">{business.testimonials.map(r=><blockquote><b>“</b><p>{r.quote}</p><footer><span>{r.name}<small>{r.detail}</small></span><em>SAMPLE</em></footer></blockquote>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="quote" class="section-pad quote"><div class="wrap quote-grid"><div class="quote-intro"><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> REQUEST A QUOTE</div><h2>Let's get the<br/><span>details flowing.</span></h2><p>Tell us what is happening and how to reach you. The business will follow up to discuss your request.</p><div class="message-card"><small>PREFER A QUICK MESSAGE?</small><strong>{wa?'WhatsApp the business':'WhatsApp is not configured'}</strong>{wa&&<a href={'https://wa.me/'+business.whatsappNumber.replace(/\D/g,'')+'?text='+encodeURIComponent(business.whatsappGreeting)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">↗</a>}</div><p class="privacy-note">Your details are used to respond to your enquiry. Review the business privacy information before sending personal information.</p></div><div class="quote-card"><header><span>PLUMBING ENQUIRY</span><span>ABOUT 2 MINUTES</span></header><QuoteForm business={business}/></div></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="section-pad contact"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow dark"><i></i> HERE WHEN YOU NEED US</div><h2>Let's make contact.</h2><p>For service questions, availability and next steps, contact the business directly.</p></div><div class="contact-list"><div><small>CALL</small>{business.phone?<a href={'tel:'+business.phone.replace(/[^+\d]/g,'')}>{business.phone} ↗</a>:<span>Configure a business phone number</span>}</div><div><small>EMAIL</small><a href={'mailto:'+business.email}>{business.email} ↗</a></div><div><small>SERVICE LOCATION</small><span>{business.address}</span></div><div><small>BUSINESS HOURS</small><span>{business.hours[0][0]} · {business.hours[0][1]}</span></div><div><small>EMERGENCY AVAILABILITY</small><span>{business.emergency.enabled?business.emergency.availability:'Not enabled in this demo'}</span></div></div></div></section></main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-main"><div><a class="brand footer-brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-mark">⌁</span><span><strong>{business.name}</strong><small>{business.brandLabel}</small></span></a><p>{business.tagline}</p></div><nav><b>EXPLORE</b><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#areas">Service areas</a><a href="#quote">Request a quote</a></nav><nav><b>CONTACT</b><a href={'mailto:'+business.email}>{business.email}</a>{business.phone&&<a href={'tel:'+business.phone}>{business.phone}</a>}<span>{business.address}</span><span>{business.hours[0][0]} · {business.hours[0][1]}</span></nav><a class="back-top" href="#top" aria-label="Back to top">↑</a></div><div class="wrap footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {business.name}. Demonstration business content.</span><div>{business.privacyUrl?<a href={business.privacyUrl}>Privacy policy</a>:<a href={'mailto:'+business.email+'?subject=Privacy%20enquiry'}>Privacy enquiries</a>}<span>Website by {business.siteCredit}</span></div></div></footer></BaseLayout>